        "text": "Summary\nIn this chapter, we emphasized the importance of virtualization on a Linux system. We showed you\nhow to create and manage VMs using KVM. You know how to clone, template, and manage resources\nfor VMs; and you know how virtualization works and how to install the QEMU/KVM hypervisor on\nLinux. With those assets, you are prepared to start your path into virtualization with no fears.\nIn the next chapter, we will introduce you to Docker container technologies.",
